varmajvālana*mastrato'rghyapraṣitaiḥ saṃprokṣaṇaṃ syā ? puna-* (l5.)
	rvāmāgnijvalanaṃ garbharacitaṃ cādāya tatkaṅkaṇam||2|| 

deyaṃ kāñcanakaṃ kaṇaṃ ca *...hṛdā saṃpūjanam sūtakā-* (l6.)
