pūjyaṃ tattva tadīśvara*trayamadho nyasyātra śaktiṃ śivaṃ* (l6.)
	paścāttanmayabhāvasūtrakalanandarbhaisthiti hṛdya ca||6||

evaṃ sṛksṛvaśuddhayaḥ śaśikalāvīkṣādi*hṛdyārcanā-* (p109a, l1.)
	paryantā tathamājyaśuddhiriti cet sākalyataḥ socyate|
ājyaṃ śodhitamīkṣaṇādibhiradho(tho) kuṇḍopari bhrāmaṇaṃ 
